      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ACCEPTED ACTIONABLE UPDATE\n\n1. Commit memory vN+1 and invalidate the old decision under one coordination boundary.\n2. Request cancellation; suppress late outputs even when cancellation fails.\n3. Reconsider with current evidence + memory vN+1; later turns retain applicable state.",
      "originalText": "ACCEPTED ACTIONABLE UPDATE\n\n1. Commit memory vN+1 and invalidate the old decision under one coordination boundary.\n2. Request cancellation; suppress late outputs even when cancellation fails.\n3. Reconsider with current evidence + memory vN+1; later turns retain applicable state.",
